WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:07.270
Speaker 1: So yesterday there was a press
briefing from Nashville PD after the shooting

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:11.870
at the Covenant School, this horrible event
in which six people were killed and the shooter

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:18.230
also died and a parent was actually able to
get on air, which was fantastic.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:23.000
And as The Daily Beast writes, a mother visiting
Nashville took to the Fox News airwaves to

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.099
call out the country's lack of gun safety
as yet another mass shooting unfolded at a

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:29.099
Nashville school.

00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:34.719
This was as reporters and crews were waiting
for a police press conference to start.

00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:41.270
The woman has been identified by local reporters
as Ashby Beasley, who herself survived the

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:47.640
July four parade in Highland Park, Illinois,
and was a block away from the Covenant School

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.739
yesterday.

00:00:48.739 --> 00:00:49.770
Here she is jumping in.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.320
And this is.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.320
Take a listen.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.800
Speaker 2: She was tired of covering this.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.579
Aren't you guys tired of being here and having
to cover all of these mass shootings?

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:00.219
I'm from Highland Park.

00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:03.500
Speaker 1: The audio briefly cuts out, but
then it comes back.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.979
Speaker 2: Family vacation with my son visiting
my sister in law.

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:13.510
I have been lobbying in DC since we survived
a mass shooting in July.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.450
I have met with over 130 lawmakers.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.659
How is this still happening?

00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:20.240
How are our children still dying?

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.060
And why are we failing them?

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:25.560
Gun violence is the number one killer of children
and teens.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.799
It has overtaken cars.

00:01:27.799 --> 00:01:31.560
Assault weapons are contributing to the border
crisis and fentanyl.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.950
We are arming cartels with our guns and our
guns.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:35.180
Loose gun laws.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:39.799
And these shootings and these mass shootings
will continue to happen until our lawmakers

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.560
step up and have gun safety legislation.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:47.210
Speaker 1: Yeah, but instead, they want to
pass laws about critical race theory books

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.060
that need to be banned.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.210
Art that needs to be banned.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.770
History that can't be taught.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.079
Sex education that can't be taught.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.830
They want to do everything other than actually
deal with what is at issue here.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:02:01.600
Speaker 2: I'm pretty sure this was an unsecured
weapon that this teenager got a hold up.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.909
We can't even pass gun safe storage laws in
this country to protect kids from getting

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:12.750
a hold of weapons that they shoot each other
when.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.310
Speaker 3: All right.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:19.900
So we're going to break away there because
that reporter who is using that camera is

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.410
obviously setting up to do a live report there.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.390
But the woman said it quite simply.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:26.430
Aren't you tired of this?

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.519
Yes, we are tired of this.

00:02:27.519 --> 00:02:28.519
Yeah.

00:02:28.519 --> 00:02:32.489
Speaker 1: Of course, most of Fox News disagrees
with what needs to be done in order to try

00:02:32.489 --> 00:02:34.629
to resolve the situation.

00:02:34.629 --> 00:02:36.610
Good for her.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:42.000
Sounds weird to say right place, right time,
because the right place is not really being

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.400
a block away from a shooting that's extremely
dangerous.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:48.700
But the right place, right time to at least
get that out on national television and absolutely

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.700
good for her.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:53.709
They want to ban all sorts of stuff, but it's
all the wrong things and we're going to continue

00:02:53.709 --> 00:02:54.709
covering it.

00:02:54.709 --> 00:02:57.530
We'll take a break and be back with plenty
more right after this

